👉 Enum ek special class hoti hai jisme fixed values store hoti hain.

  from enum import Enum
  
  class Status(Enum):
      APPROVED = 1
      PENDING = 2
      REJECTED = 3
  
  status = Status.APPROVED
  
  if status == Status.APPROVED:
      print("Admission Done")

👉 Enums improve code readability by replacing magic values with meaningful names.

Advantages
  👉 Better readability
  👉 Prevent invalid values
  👉 Easy comparison
  👉 Easy maintenance
  👉 Less typing mistakes
  👉 Cleaner code
  👉 Better debugging
  👉 Better IDE support

Disadvantages
  👉 Slightly more code
  👉 Not suitable for frequently changing values
  👉 Requires importing enum

Where Enum is Used
  👉 User Roles
  👉 Payment Status
  👉 Order Status
  👉 Gender
  👉 Traffic Signal
  👉 Days
  👉 Months
  👉 Directions
  👉 HTTP Status
  👉 Game States
  👉 School ERP Status

