👉 Enum is a special class for creating named constants.
👉 It is imported using from enum import Enum.
👉 Each enum member has a .name and a .value.
👉 Enums make code cleaner, safer, and easier to maintain.
👉 They are ideal for fixed values like roles, statuses, colors, days, and months.

